{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40011","headline":"伤前翰林杨左丞 · 徐夤","name":"伤前翰林杨左丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞上鳌头侍玉皇，三台遗耀换余光。\n人间搦管穷苍颉，地上修文待卜商。\n真魄肯随金石化，真风留伴蕙兰香。\n皇天未啓昇平运，不使伊臯相禹汤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}